The brand mark, which conventionally links back to the homepage"},{"key":"links","cn":"导航链接","en":"Nav Links","desc":"数量由信息架构和可用空间决定，并标识当前项","desc_en":"Navigation links; their number depends on the information architecture and available space, and the current item is identified"},{"key":"action","cn":"主要操作","en":"Action","desc":"需要时放置登录、注册或试用等高频操作","desc_en":"An optional high-frequency action, such as sign-in, registration, or a trial"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"品牌 + 链接","en":"Standard","demo":"<span class=\"navbar-v\"><b>◆</b><i>产品 定价 文档</i></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"navbar-v\"><b>◆</b><i>Product Pricing Documentation</i></span>","when":"入口较少、层级清楚的站点导航","when_en":"For a site with a small, clearly organized set of navigation links"},{"cn":"带主要操作","en":"WithCTA","demo":"<span class=\"navbar-v\"><b>◆</b><i>产品 定价</i><em>免费开始</em></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"navbar-v\"><b>◆</b><i>Product Pricing</i><em>Start for Free</em></span>","when":"注册、登录或试用是高频下一步时","when_en":"When signing up, signing in, or starting a trial is a common next step"},{"cn":"吸顶","en":"Sticky","demo":"<span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:96px\"><span class=\"navbar-v\" style=\"width:100%\"><b>◆</b><i>产品 定价</i></span><span class=\"navbar-v-body\"></span></span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;width:96px\"><span class=\"navbar-v\" style=\"width:100%\"><b>◆</b><i>Product Pricing</i></span><span class=\"navbar-v-body\"></span></span>","when":"长页面需要频繁跨页导航时","when_en":"When long pages need persistent cross-page navigation"}],"use":[{"t":"按内容组织<b>品牌、核心入口和必要操作</b>：三段式只是常见布局，搜索、登录、语言切换或多级导航可另行编排","m":"navbar-parts"},{"t":"用<b>当前位置标记</b>帮助用户确认所在页面或栏目","m":"menu-top"},{"t":"长页面需要频繁跨页导航时，可让导航栏<b>吸顶</b>，同时避免遮挡正文","m":"navbar-sticky"},{"t":"同一长页面内的分节跳转更适合使用 {c:anchor}","m":"anchor-landing"}],"dont":[{"t":"把大量同级入口全部平铺，会让主要路径难以识别","m":"menu-crowded","bad":true},{"t":"把保存、删除等当前页面动作当成主要导航入口","m":"menu-action","bad":true},{"t":"桌面空间充足时仍把所有主要入口藏进菜单，会增加访问步骤","m":"navbar-burger","bad":true},{"t":"没有当前位置标记，用户难以确认自己所在页面或栏目","m":"navbar-noactive","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"官网的“产品、模板、价格、博客”需要在各页面保持一致，并清楚标出当前栏目。应该放在哪里？","options":[{"id":"global-navbar","label":"放进全站顶部导航栏，并高亮当前栏目","feedback":"这些是跨页面的核心目的地，持续可见的导航栏能提供稳定入口和位置提示。","correct":true},{"id":"local-tabs","label":"每个页面各自放一组内容页签","feedback":"页签用于同一页面或对象内的平级内容，不适合承担全站主要目的地。","correct":false},{"id":"desktop-drawer","label":"桌面端默认藏进右侧抽屉，需要时再打开","feedback":"桌面空间充足时隐藏所有核心入口会增加访问步骤，也削弱当前位置提示。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Product, Templates, Pricing, and Blog must stay consistent across the site and show the current section. Where should they go?","options":[{"id":"global-navbar","label":"Place them in a global top navbar and highlight the current section","feedback":"These are major cross-page destinations, so a persistent navbar provides stable access and location.","correct":true},{"id":"local-tabs","label":"Create a separate set of content tabs on every page","feedback":"Tabs organize peer content within one page or object, not the site's main destinations.","correct":false},{"id":"desktop-drawer","label":"Hide them in a right drawer by default on desktop","feedback":"Hiding every core destination despite available space adds steps and weakens location awareness.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"让“产品、模板、价格、博客”在所有官网页面使用同一套顶部导航，并高亮当前栏目。请验证各链接目的地、键盘焦点、吸顶时不遮正文，以及移动端菜单能打开和关闭。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use one consistent top navbar for Product, Templates, Pricing, and Blog across the site and highlight the current section. Verify destinations, focus, sticky overlap, and opening and closing the mobile menu."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"navbar-demo navbar-demo-pair\">\n    <div class=\"navbar-d-win\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-d-cap\">页面顶部</span>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ VibeUI</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">组件</a><a>术语</a><a>模板</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-cta\">免费开始</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\"><i style=\"width:46%\"></i><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"navbar-d-win\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-d-cap\">向下滚动 · 吸顶</span>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar sticky\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ VibeUI</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">组件</a><a>术语</a><a>模板</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-cta\">免费开始</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\"><i style=\"width:58%\"></i><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":"大型下拉菜单适合网站导航","source":"NN/g","url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/mega-menus-work-well/","title_en":"Mega Menus Work Well for Site Navigation"}],"scenes":["官网顶部导航","文档站吸顶栏","电商站点导航","博客极简顶栏"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"navbar-demo navbar-demo-pair\">\n    <div class=\"navbar-d-win\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-d-cap\">Top of page</span>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ VibeUI</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">Component</a><a>Term</a><a>Template</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-cta\">Start for free</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\"><i style=\"width:46%\"></i><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"navbar-d-win\">\n      <span class=\"navbar-d-cap\">Scroll down · Ceiling</span>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar sticky\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ VibeUI</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">Component</a><a>Term</a><a>Template</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-cta\">Start for free</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\"><i style=\"width:58%\"></i><i style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>","use":[{"t":"Primary website navigation","m":"navbar-parts"},{"t":"Brand and home link","m":"menu-top"},{"t":"Access to sign in or a key action","m":"navbar-sticky"},{"t":"A compact menu that remains consistent across pages","m":"anchor-landing"}],"dont":[{"t":"Put every page in the top row","m":"menu-crowded","bad":true},{"t":"Use labels that change between pages","m":"menu-action","bad":true},{"t":"Hide important links only in a desktop hover menu","m":"navbar-burger","bad":true},{"t":"Let a sticky navbar cover the content below","m":"navbar-noactive","bad":true}],"scenes":["Company site","Product site","Documentation header","Mobile navigation"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"navbar-demo\">\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ VibeUI</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">Products</a><a>Templates</a><a>Pricing</a><a>Blog</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-search\">⌕ Search…</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-cta\">Start for free</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\" style=\"min-height:52px\"><i style=\"width:38%\"></i><i style=\"width:56%\"></i></div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"navbar-demo\">\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar sticky\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ Document Center</span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-links\"><a class=\"on\">Guidelines</a><a>API</a><a>Change Log</a></span>\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-search\">⌕ Search documents…</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px\">v2.4 ▾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-body\" style=\"min-height:60px;justify-content:center\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Guide/Quick Start</span>\n        <i style=\"width:44%\"></i><i style=\"width:66%\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"navbar-demo\">\n      <div class=\"navbar-d-bar\">\n        <span class=\"navbar-d-logo\">◆ Orange Selection Mall</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;di